      "name": "Keto Lamb Chops [with Cauliflower Mash]",
      "description": "Tender meat served with mashed potatoes is one of the best culinary combinations there is. Going keto doesn’t mean you have to give up your mash. Instead of potatoes, you can use cauliflower to make a smooth, creamy mash that’s low-carb and tastes amazing. One of the best cuts of meat to compliment your cauliflower mash are lamb chops. Once you’ve tried this combo once, it’s sure to become one of your favorites.\n\nCooking up this lamb chop recipe involves two simple steps. The first step is to make the mashed cauliflower. This can be done by boiling the cauliflower and then blending it with the Swiss cheese and sour cream to give it some extra richness. Once the mash is ready, the second step is to cook the chops. Cooking lamb chops is best done in a searing hot frying pan. Simply cover the chops in the herbs and spices and then fry them on both sides until cooked. All that’s left to do now is plate them up and enjoy.\n\nThis keto-friendly recipe is packed full of goodness. The cauliflower is low carb, a great source of antioxidants, and is noted for boosting heart health. Lamb chops are protein-rich and a great source of iron and vitamin B.\n\nFor a tasty, guilt-free meal, why not try this lamb chops and cauliflower mash dish for dinner tonight!\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\nLamb Chops:\n24 ounce lamb chop\n2 tablespoon fresh rosemary, chopped\n4 teaspoon fresh garlic, minced\nSalt and pepper to taste\n1 tablespoon olive oil\n\nCauliflower Mash:\n1 medium cauliflower\n2 tablespoon Swiss cheese\n2 tablespoon sour cream\n2 tablespoon butter\n1/2 teaspoon sea salt\n2 tablespoon green onion\n\nNutrition Summary: This makes a total of 4 servings of Keto Lamb Chops with Cauliflower Mash. Each serving comes out to be 598 calories, 38.7g fat, 4.1g net carbs, and 57.5g protein.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 14 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
